Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 13:59:29 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Credit native clock origins and flush APU at completed
 instruction boundaries

Prepared for issue #205 from the bounded Gaia consumer timing work. Based on current main 66eebe6; prerequisite PRs remain unmerged. Rebase on eventual merged heads before submission. Canonical interpretation remains available; no combined-game or hardware qualification is claimed.
